lass=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'['</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> first<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> x <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> xz<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>first <span class=\"sy4\">?</span> first <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"\"</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> x<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/deque\"><span class=\"kw1279\">std::<span class=\"me2\">deque</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> numbers<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    stq<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">println</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"{}\"</span>, numbers<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">while</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>not numbers.<span class=\"me1\">empty</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        numbers.<span class=\"me1\">pop_back</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        stq<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">println</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"{}\"</span>, numbers<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>[1, 2, 3]\n[1, 2]\n[1]\n[]</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/deque/pop_front\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>pop_front</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  removes the first element <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/deque/push_back\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>push_back</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  adds an element to the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/deque","title":"std::deque"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::deque<T,Allocator>::pop_back","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Remove